<title>INDIA: India Shipping Corp 96/97 net down.</title>
<headline>India Shipping Corp 96/97 net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   2,566.6    vs	3,234.0</p>
<p>    Income		22,704.5    vs     21,139.7</p>
<p>    Other income	 1,398.2    vs	1,343.8</p>
<p>    Expenditure	 17,126.9    vs     15,306.9</p>
<p>    Interest	     1,662.0    vs	1,618.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 2,297.2    vs	2,324.0</p>
<p>    Tax			450.0    vs	  nil</p>
<p>Note: State-owned Shipping Corporation of India said it had paid tax for the first time in 1996/97. The company said it had shown better trading results despite &quot;relatively lower freight rate levels in various market segments during the year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
